<p class="schedule-type-label">Online Sessions</p>

<p>Online classes and one-on-one sessions are available at flexible times. These are offered by Jenny, Seb, or both together depending on the session type. Please enquire to arrange a time that works for you.</p>

<div class="shared-story">
<p><strong>Jenny offers online:</strong> Yoga Teacher Training, Vinyasa Yoga, Hatha Yoga, Yin Yoga and other related classes. </p>
<p><strong>Seb offers online:</strong> Qigong (various forms) and private one-on-one Qigong sessions with specific applications.</p>
<p><strong>Jenny & Seb offer together online:</strong> training options related to Qigong, meditation sessions.</p>
</div>

<p>To book an online session, please get in touch through any of the channels on our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>

<hr class="section-divider">

<h2>What to Expect: Qigong with Seb</h2>

<ul class="features">
<li>Genuine, unadulterated Qigong - as it should be</li>
<li>A welcoming atmosphere for all abilities</li>
<li>Sessions lasting 60 to 75 minutes</li>
<li>Five-Element Qigong forms</li>
<li>Extraordinary-Meridian Qigong forms</li>
<li>Shen (higher awareness) Qigong forms and esoteric practices</li>
<li>Bagua Chun Gen (a versatile energy-gate-opening form)</li>
<li>Medical Qigong elements for practitioners of Tui Na, An Mo, Shiatsu, Nuad Thai, etc.</li>
<li>Self-care and healing Qigong for those with chronic ailments or disabilities</li>
<li>Zhan Zhuang - challenging yet deeply rewarding standing postures that develop endurance, rooted stability and explosive vitality</li>
</ul>

